{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05865","headline":"送张舍人佐江州同薛璩十韵 · 王维","name":"送张舍人佐江州同薛璩十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"束带趋承明，守官唯谒者。\n清晨听银蚪，薄暮辞金马。\n受辞未尝易，当是方知寡。\n清范何风流，高文有风雅。\n忽佐江上州，当自浔阳下。\n逆旅到三湘，长途应百舍。\n香炉远峰出，石镜澄湖泻。\n董奉杏成林，陶潜菊盈把。\n范蠡常好之，庐山我心也。\n送君思远道，欲以数行洒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}